  "question": "Where can I find the nearest fish restaurant in the vicinity of Lander Trail, Afton, WY?",
  "sql": "SELECT P.poi_name, P.addr_city, P.addr_state FROM pois AS P WHERE P.amenity = 'restaurant' AND (P.cuisine ILIKE '%fish%' OR P.cuisine ILIKE '%seafood%') ORDER BY P.geometry <-> ( SELECT R.geometry FROM roads AS R WHERE R.road_name ILIKE '%Lander Trail%' AND ST_Intersects(R.geometry, ( SELECT geometry FROM regions WHERE region_name ILIKE '%Afton%' AND border_type = 'city' LIMIT 1 )::geography) LIMIT 1 )::geography LIMIT 1;",
